texas/coke-county"],["ARC or PLC in Coke County","/arc-plc/texas/coke-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Coke County came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years for March to April and again for August to September. In 2025, February to March on the middle of the grids ran 10% of normal, and July to August ran 156%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 14217 got 36% of normal that year.</p>"}
